{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐细节和逐小节情绪变化不如X细密，尤其是旋律、声部、力度和情绪转折的对应关系，X提供了更多具体线索。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的优势是把人物的念头、顾虑和行动连成了自然的因果链，观众即使没读过原文，也容易抓住每段发生了什么、为什么发生，以及它怎样推动下一段。X的音乐感受更细密，部分逐小节出现的描述很有价值，但相近感受堆叠较多，容易让人顾着辨认词语而错过人物主线；Y则牺牲了一部分音乐细节，换来了更顺畅的阅读和更完整的情感体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ee27d793-436c-4460-8a5b-229f992ec2d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T162710843986Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:28:20.164180+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ce608452e3babf801a420cabf415fb04084abf6be39e70499067750d9571423", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee